  "title": "Instruction of Isa ibn Maryam (a.s.) for the Ailment of Pale Faces & Dark Eyes",
  "data": "Imam Ali Amir al-Mu'minin (a.s.) is reported to have said: Jesus the son of Mary (a.s.) passed by a village and noticed that the faces of its people were yellowish and their eyes dark. They complained to him of the many ailments from which they suffered. Prophet Jesus (a.s.) said to them, “This is because you eat the meat of camels before you wash it. No animal departs this life without impurity attaching to it.” When they followed his instruction and began washing the meat before cooking it, they recovered their health and were rid of their old ailments.\nPassing by another village, Prophet Jesus (a.s.) noticed that the teeth of its people were decayed and their faces swollen. He said to them, “When you sleep, keep your mouths open and do not shut them.” When they followed his instruction, their disease disappeared."
}
